usage: run_benchmark.py [-h] [--target TARGET] [--target-sha TARGET_SHA]
                        [--mode {dev,test}] [--tasks TASKS] [--model MODEL]
                        [--provider PROVIDER] [--turn-budget TURN_BUDGET]
                        [--replicates REPLICATES] [--run-root RUN_ROOT]
                        [--dry-run] [--verify-only] [--worktree WORKTREE]

Run live PolyFlow/RCIR benchmark experiments.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --target TARGET       Target repository identifier.
  --target-sha TARGET_SHA
                        Pinned target commit SHA.
  --mode {dev,test}     Experiment mode (dev or test).
  --tasks TASKS         Path to public tasks manifest JSON.
  --model MODEL         LLM model name.
  --provider PROVIDER   LLM provider name.
  --turn-budget TURN_BUDGET
                        Max agent turns per trial.
  --replicates REPLICATES
                        Replication count per task.
  --run-root RUN_ROOT   Output directory for immutable runs.
  --dry-run             Validate setup, task oracles, and provider without
                        executing agent.
  --verify-only         Run multi-tier evaluation on an existing worktree.
  --worktree WORKTREE   Worktree path for --verify-only mode.
